# Dragging plan rows. Plan: image; Alabanza [pages, video]; Palabra [image].
# While held, the carried rows leave the list, a gap opens where they'd
# land and a card follows the pointer. A section carries its steps and
# lands only between sections. Esc lets go without moving anything.
wait 2500
add fixtures/image.png
section 10 Alabanza
add fixtures/pages.pdf
add fixtures/video.mp4
section 5 Palabra
add fixtures/image.png
wait 800
shot 0-plan
# The loose image, into Alabanza as its first step.
drag 1 2 below
wait 300
shot 1-step-held-into-a-section
drop
wait 300
shot 2-step-dropped
# Alabanza (now first) with its three steps, after Palabra.
drag 1 5 below
wait 300
shot 3-section-held-after-palabra
drop
wait 300
shot 4-section-dropped
# Held, then Esc: nothing moves.
drag 1 4 above
wait 200
press escape
drop
wait 300
shot 5-cancelled
